 MAN IS A SINGULAR CREATURE.  HE HAS A SET OF GIFTS
 WHICH MAKE HIM UNIQUE AMONG THE ANIMALS: SO THAT, 
 UNLIKE THEM, HE IS NOT A FIGURE IN THE LANDSCAPE --
 HE IS A SHAPER OF THE LANDSCAPE.

                       -- JACOB BRONOWSKI
